=2 Walkthrough
* **Note: Several fish are noted in this mission: {i:Blackened Siredon|Blackened Siredon|5266}, {i:Forest Carp|Forest Carp|4289}, {i:Greedie|Greedie|4500}, and {i:Pipira|Pipira|4464}. You will need to obtain at least one of these fish to complete this mission. It is suggested to obtain one from the {z:Auction House} or some other means before going to {z:Windurst Waters (S)}. Which fish you end up using does affect the cutscene received (see below) but the end result of progressing is the same.**

!West Sarutabaruta (S) Map.png||Map of West Sarutabaruta (S)
* Begin the quest by speaking to {n:Dhea Prandoleh} at H-10 in {z:Windurst Waters (S)}.
* The next cutscene is located at the magic tower at F-11 in {z:West Sarutabaruta (S)}. Examine the Sealed Entrance for a cutscene.
** **(Optional)** Examine it again for a second cutscene where Lehko Habhoka complains of his hunger pains.
* Speak with Dhea again and you will be suggested to trade one of the items listed in the previous cutscene.
** **(Optional)** Speak with {n:Chioh Remhrll}, {n:Kleh Engyumoh}, or {n:Tohs Jhannih} for some optional __flavor__ text about their suggestions.
* Return to the Sealed Entrance and trade fish to satisfy Lehko's hunger.
** Trading any fish listed above other than {i:Blackened Siredon|Blackened Siredon|5266} and then selecting "No" after the first "Yes" is enough to progress with the mission but results in a slightly shorter cutscene.
** Trading him a {i:Blackened Siredon|Blackened Siredon|5266} or any combination of three of the other fish will result in a slightly longer cutscene with no other reward for doing so.
* A cutscene with a couple of options will start. You can choose them in any order.
* Once the cutscene is over you will be given 12 {i:Red Roses|Red Rose|941} and the quest will now be complete.
* Zoning back into {z:Windurst Waters (S)} will start the next quest, {q:A Feast for Gnats|A Feast for Gnats|A Feast for Gnats}.

=2 Notes
* If you want to view the longer cutscene afterwards without collecting the required fish, it will be played if you visit the {p:Goblin Footprint} to replay the cutscene.

